 ('src1', "Four sources. The Arthashastra, for theory. Megasthenes' Indica, for an outsider's description — though it survives only as fragments quoted by later Greek writers, which is a real limitation. The edicts, for administration in the ruler's own words. And excavation at Pataliputra and elsewhere."),
